{
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Schwung",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Shortcuts",
          "lines": [
            "How the shadow UI",
            "opens is your choice:",
            "Global Settings >",
            "Shortcuts > Open With",
            " Both (default)",
            " Sh+Vol",
            " Hold",
            "",
            "Shift+Vol combos:",
            "+Track 1-4: jump to",
            " slot settings",
            "+Menu: Master FX",
            "+Step 2: Global",
            " settings",
            "+Step 13: Tools menu",
            "+Jog Click: Tools",
            " menu (also exits an",
            " overtake module)",
            "+Left/Right: change",
            " set page",
            "",
            "Hold gestures:",
            "Hold Track 1-4: slot",
            " settings",
            "Hold Menu: Master FX",
            "Shift + hold Step 2:",
            " Global settings",
            "Shift+Step 13: Tools",
            "",
            "Tap Track or Menu",
            "again to dismiss.",
            "",
            "Anywhere:",
            "Shift+Menu: Master FX",
            " (double-click it to",
            " toggle the screen",
            " reader)",
            "Shift+Sample:",
            " quantized sampler",
            "Shift+Capture:",
            " skipback",
            "",
            "Overlay Knobs let the",
            "8 knobs edit slot",
            "params without the",
            "shadow UI on screen.",
            "Global Settings >",
            "Display > Overlay:",
            " Native (default):",
            "  use Move's own",
            "  Schwung Slot preset",
            "  macros",
            " Shift: hold Shift",
            " Jog: touch the jog",
            " Off",
            "",
            "Use Jog or Off to",
            "avoid Shift+Knob",
            "conflicts."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Global Settings",
          "lines": [
            "Shift+Vol+Step 2,",
            "or Shift + hold",
            "Step 2.",
            "",
            "Seven pages, one",
            "per section:",
            " Display, Audio,",
            " Screen Reader,",
            " Set Pages,",
            " Shortcuts,",
            " Services, Updates",
            "",
            "Jog: change page",
            "Shift+Jog: pick a",
            " section by name",
            "Click: open the",
            " page you are on",
            "Back: leave ME",
            "",
            "Param View (in",
            "Display) chooses",
            "knobs or a list.",
            "The screen reader",
            "always gets the",
            "list.",
            "",
            "[Help...] is the",
            "last entry on the",
            "Updates page."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Connecting Tracks",
          "lines": [
            "Set each Move track",
            "MIDI Out to ch 1-4.",
            "",
            "Set each slot Recv",
            "Ch to match (1-4).",
            "",
            "Play the track to",
            "trigger the slot",
            "synth.",
            "",
            "Tip: load an empty",
            "Drum Rack or Sampler",
            "preset on the Move",
            "track to silence the",
            "native sound.",
            "",
            "Pitch bend, mod",
            "wheel, sustain, and",
            "CCs are forwarded",
            "from external MIDI."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Instrument Slots",
          "lines": [
            "4 slots, each a",
            "chain you build:",
            "up to 8 MIDI FX >",
            "Synth > up to 8",
            "Audio FX.",
            "",
            "Jog wheel scrolls,",
            "click enters, back",
            "goes up a level.",
            "",
            "The + boxes add a",
            "module where they",
            "are drawn.",
            "",
            "Shift+Jog Click on",
            "a loaded module to",
            "swap it.",
            "",
            "Shift+Jog reorders.",
            "Adding, moving or",
            "removing never",
            "restarts what is",
            "already in the",
            "chain: an arp keeps",
            "its phase, a reverb",
            "keeps its tail.",
            "",
            "Touch a knob to see",
            "what it does. A",
            "card shows that",
            "knob and its three",
            "neighbours, with",
            "names and values.",
            "Let go and the",
            "chain is back.",
            "",
            "A knob that picks",
            "from a list opens",
            "it: hold the knob",
            "and click. Jog to",
            "choose, click to",
            "set, Back cancels.",
            "",
            "Just turning it",
            "shows the list too,",
            "briefly. That one",
            "is only a readout -",
            "the turn already",
            "changed the value.",
            "Back closes it.",
            "",
            "The knob rings show",
            "which knob is which",
            "cell: 1-4 white,",
            "5-8 amber, brighter",
            "as the value rises.",
            "Dark means nothing",
            "is mapped there."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Component Actions",
          "lines": [
            "Jog past a loaded",
            "module's last knob",
            "page for two more:",
            "",
            "My Presets: shows",
            "the loaded preset",
            "(* = changed since",
            "load), then Load,",
            "Save, Save As,",
            "Delete.",
            "",
            "Module: Module Help",
            "(if that module ships",
            "any), Swap Module,",
            "Remove Module.",
            "",
            "Module Help opens",
            "that module's own",
            "help topics. Back",
            "returns you to the",
            "module.",
            "",
            "Both are lists -",
            "jog to an entry and",
            "click to run it.",
            "Jogging past does",
            "not fire anything."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Slot Settings",
          "lines": [
            "Last position in",
            "each slot's menu.",
            "",
            "Knobs 1-8: assign",
            "params from loaded",
            "modules.",
            "",
            "Volume: per-slot",
            "output level.",
            "",
            "Recv Ch: MIDI ch",
            "this slot listens.",
            "",
            "Fwd Ch modes:",
            " Auto: remap to recv",
            " Thru: passthrough",
            " 1-16: force channel",
            "",
            "LFO 1/2: modulation",
            "sources (see LFOs).",
            "",
            "Save/Load slot",
            "presets from here."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Bypass, Mute, Solo",
          "lines": [
            "While shadow UI is",
            "shown:",
            "",
            "Mute+Jog Click on a",
            "focused module:",
            "toggle bypass. Audio",
            "passes through, the",
            "module keeps running",
            "so tails ring out.",
            "A 'B' glyph shows",
            "above the module.",
            "",
            "Mute+Track 1-4:",
            "mute that slot.",
            "Shift+Mute+Track:",
            "solo that slot.",
            "",
            "Bypass persists via",
            "slot autosave;",
            "loading a patch",
            "clears it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "LFOs",
          "lines": [
            "Each slot has 2 LFOs",
            "that modulate any",
            "parameter of any",
            "module in the chain.",
            "",
            "Shapes: Sine, Tri,",
            "Saw, Square, S&H,",
            "Swishy (random walk)",
            "",
            "Sync: free Hz or",
            "tempo-synced (8bar",
            "to 1/32 note).",
            "",
            "Retrigger: resets",
            "phase on first",
            "note-on of a phrase.",
            "",
            "Target: pick the",
            "module, then the",
            "section, then the",
            "parameter. Sections",
            "match the knob",
            "pages; unfiled",
            "params are under",
            "Other. Reopening",
            "lands on the",
            "current target.",
            "",
            "LFOs can target",
            "each other for",
            "complex modulation.",
            "",
            "Master FX also has",
            "2 LFOs (in the",
            "Master FX menu).",
            "",
            "~1/~2 indicators",
            "show active targets",
            "in chain editor."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sets & Slots",
          "lines": [
            "Each Move Set keeps",
            "its own slots.",
            "",
            "Switching Sets saves",
            "your current slots",
            "and loads the new",
            "Set's slots.",
            "",
            "Changes are local to",
            "the Set. Editing a",
            "synth in one Set",
            "won't affect others.",
            "",
            "Presets are separate:",
            "loading a preset",
            "copies it into the",
            "Set. Tweaks stay in",
            "the Set, not the",
            "preset.",
            "",
            "New Sets start with",
            "empty slots."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set Pages",
          "lines": [
            "Move holds one",
            "library of Sets.",
            "Set Pages gives you",
            "8 of them.",
            "",
            "Shift+Vol+Left or",
            "Right changes page.",
            "A toast shows which",
            "page you are on.",
            "",
            "Each page has its",
            "own Sets and its own",
            "Schwung slots. The",
            "Move restarts as it",
            "switches, so give it",
            "a moment.",
            "",
            "Turn it off in",
            "Global Settings >",
            "Set Pages if you do",
            "not want the",
            "shortcut."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Master FX",
          "lines": [
            "Open: Shift+Vol+Menu,",
            "Shift+Menu, or hold",
            "Menu.",
            "",
            "8 audio FX slots",
            "that process the",
            "mixed output of all",
            "instrument slots.",
            "",
            "Picking None on a",
            "slot unloads it and",
            "leaves the hole -",
            "there is no insert,",
            "remove or reorder",
            "here yet.",
            "",
            "LFO 1/2 can target",
            "any master FX param.",
            "",
            "Settings > MIDI Ch",
            "picks which channel",
            "MIDI-driven FX",
            "listen to (see MFX",
            "MIDI Channel)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Link Audio",
          "lines": [
            "Requires Move 2.0+.",
            "",
            "Routes Move track",
            "audio through Schwung",
            "FX chains.",
            "",
            "Setup:",
            "1.Enable Link in",
            "  Move Settings",
            "2.Global Settings",
            "  > Audio >",
            "  Move->Schwung: On",
            "",
            "Track N maps to",
            "Slot N audio input.",
            "",
            "When on, Move native",
            "Master FX bypassed.",
            "",
            "Brief play delay",
            "from Link quantum.",
            "",
            "Schwung->Link",
            "publishes each slot",
            "back as an ME-N",
            "Link Audio channel.",
            "",
            "Latency Comp",
            "(Settings > Audio,",
            "default Off): aligns",
            "Move's track audio",
            "with Schwung synths",
            "when routing is on.",
            "Toggling while",
            "playing causes a",
            "brief (~16ms) blip."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Recording",
          "lines": [
            "Quantized Sampler",
            "(Shift+Sample):",
            "",
            "Choose source:",
            " Resample or",
            " Move Input",
            "Choose duration in",
            "bars, or until stop.",
            "Starts on note",
            "event or Play.",
            "Saved to Samples/",
            "Schwung/Resampler/.",
            "",
            "Skipback",
            "(Shift+Capture):",
            "",
            "Saves the audio that",
            "just played, to",
            "Samples/Schwung/",
            "Skipback/. Uses the",
            "same source setting",
            "as the sampler.",
            "",
            "Global Settings >",
            "Audio:",
            " Skipback Len picks",
            "  30s, 1m, 2m, 3m,",
            "  4m or 5m (30s is",
            "  the default)",
            " Skipback picks the",
            "  gesture: Cap",
            "  (Shift+Capture) or",
            "  Vol+Cap (Shift+Vol",
            "  +Capture), so a",
            "  bare Shift+Capture",
            "  still reaches Move"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Feedback Protection",
          "lines": [
            "A slot that listens",
            "to the line input",
            "will howl if the",
            "speakers are on and",
            "nothing is plugged",
            "into the input.",
            "",
            "Loading one in that",
            "state asks first:",
            "Jog Click proceeds,",
            "Back cancels.",
            "",
            "Schwung also watches",
            "continuously. Unplug",
            "your headphones with",
            "a line-in slot live",
            "and it bypasses that",
            "slot and says so.",
            "Plug back in and the",
            "bypass lifts itself.",
            "",
            "Override on the",
            "warning, or unbypass",
            "by hand with Mute+",
            "Jog Click, and it",
            "leaves you alone",
            "until the next boot.",
            "",
            "Restored line-input",
            "slots come up",
            "bypassed at boot for",
            "the same reason."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Overtake Modules",
          "lines": [
            "Full-screen apps",
            "that take over the",
            "display & controls.",
            "",
            "Open Tools menu:",
            " Shift+Vol+Jog Click",
            " or Shift+Vol+Step13",
            "",
            "Overtake modules",
            "appear below the",
            "divider in Tools.",
            "",
            "Exit overtake:",
            " Shift+Vol+Jog Click",
            "",
            "After exiting, pad",
            "LEDs may not refresh",
            "- change tracks to",
            "restore them."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Schwung Manager",
          "lines": [
            "Web interface at:",
            " move.local:7700",
            "",
            "Manage modules,",
            "files, settings,",
            "and system updates",
            "from any browser.",
            "",
            "Screen mirroring:",
            " move.local:7700",
            " /mirror",
            "",
            "move.local still",
            "reaches the stock",
            "Move manager.",
            "",
            "Settings sync both",
            "ways in real time."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Display Mirror",
          "lines": [
            "Stream the OLED to",
            "a web browser.",
            "",
            "Enable in Global",
            "Settings > Display",
            "> Mirror Display.",
            "",
            "Then open:",
            " move.local:7700",
            " /mirror",
            "",
            "~30 fps, supports",
            "up to 8 clients.",
            "",
            "Off by default.",
            "Persists on reboot."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Screen Reader",
          "lines": [
            "Text-to-speech for",
            "accessibility.",
            "",
            "Toggle on/off:",
            " Global Settings >",
            " Screen Reader,",
            " or double-click",
            " Shift+Menu",
            "",
            "Settings:",
            " Engine: eSpeak or",
            "  Flite",
            " Speed: 0.5x - 6x",
            " Pitch: 80-180 Hz",
            " Volume: 0 - 100%",
            " Speak Delay:",
            "  0-1000ms",
            "",
            "With the reader on,",
            "params are always",
            "shown as a list,",
            "whatever Param View",
            "says."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tools Menu",
          "lines": [
            "Open: Shift+Vol+",
            "Step 13, Shift+Vol+",
            "Jog Click, or",
            "Shift+Step 13.",
            "",
            "Tools that run",
            "outside the slot",
            "system. Overtake",
            "modules are listed",
            "below the divider.",
            "",
            "File Browser: browse",
            "and manage files on",
            "your Move. Play WAV",
            "files to preview.",
            "",
            "Install more tools",
            "from Schwung Manager",
            "at move.local:7700."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "File Browser (Web)",
          "lines": [
            "Schwung Manager has",
            "a built-in file",
            "manager at:",
            " move.local:7700",
            " /files",
            "",
            "A standalone file",
            "browser is also",
            "available at:",
            " move.local:404",
            "",
            "Enable it in Global",
            "Settings > Services",
            "> File Browser, or",
            "at move.local:7700",
            "/config.",
            "",
            "Neither one asks for",
            "a password. Anyone",
            "on the network can",
            "reach them."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "USB-C Audio Out",
          "lines": [
            "Move sends either its",
            "mic or Main Out to a",
            "connected computer,",
            "but forgets which on",
            "every power off.",
            "",
            "Pick it in Move's own",
            "Settings. Schwung",
            "restores it a few",
            "seconds after boot.",
            "",
            "Global Settings >",
            "Audio > USB-C Persist",
            "shows On/Off and the",
            "source in use.",
            "",
            "Move's screen still",
            "reads Mic even when",
            "Main Out is live -",
            "trust your ears. In",
            "that menu picking Mic",
            "really does switch it",
            "back."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MFX MIDI Channel",
          "lines": [
            "Master FX that react",
            "to MIDI - a ducker's",
            "sidechain, a slicer's",
            "trigger - listen to",
            "every channel by",
            "default.",
            "",
            "Master FX >",
            "Settings > MIDI Ch",
            "narrows that to one",
            "channel, so only the",
            "part you nominate",
            "drives them.",
            "",
            "All is the default and",
            "keeps existing setups",
            "working unchanged.",
            "",
            "Separately, Move's own",
            "step and track",
            "buttons no longer",
            "trigger audio FX -",
            "only the pads do."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Move Manual",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Loading...",
          "lines": [
            "Fetching the Move",
            "manual from",
            "ableton.com.",
            "",
            "Requires an internet",
            "connection."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Notice",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Copyright",
          "lines": [
            "Ableton Move Manual",
            "",
            "Copyright 2024",
            "Ableton AG.",
            "All rights reserved.",
            "Made in Germany.",
            "",
            "Manual content",
            "displayed with",
            "permission from",
            "Ableton AG."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Trademark Notice",
          "lines": [
            "Ableton and Move are",
            "trademarks of",
            "Ableton AG.",
            "",
            "Schwung is",
            "an independent",
            "product and has not",
            "been authorized,",
            "sponsored, or",
            "otherwise approved",
            "by Ableton AG."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
